title: 'Asset Hub Westend: teleport WND to and from Bulletin Westend'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Bulletin Westend is a sibling parachain outside the system parachain range, so Asset Hub
    Westend did not trust it for WND teleports, in either direction. Asset Hub Westend now trusts
    WND teleports with Bulletin, so WND can be teleported from Asset Hub to Bulletin and back.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: minor
